## Claim under pressure

SPRINT **T1** (CRIT 2.1 / 2.4 / 5.1–5.3): propagate SECRET through function returns;
alias rebind; if/match LBRACE walker so taint is not dropped.

Path-A product floor (SECRET_TAINT / DESIGN):
- **In:** same-fn bare IDENT sink refuse, assign/concat prop, named sinks.
- **Must not claim:** full IFC / complete interprocedural secrecy lattice.

Adversarial stance: treat interproc return + control-flow as **open until proved refuse**.

