## Recommended prove (OWN / Track B — not done here)

When tip secret sources rebuild cleanly into product host:

```bash
OODAC_BIN=./oodac/oodac
for f in secret_t1_return_local secret_t1_return_concat secret_t1_if_branch \
         secret_t1_alias_println secret_t1_bypass_return_x secret_t1_if_expr; do
  "$OODAC_BIN" emit-c fixtures/$f.oo  # expect non-zero + ERR secret for fail cases
  "$OODAC_BIN" check fixtures/$f.oo
done
bash scripts/secret_sink_enforce_smoke.sh
bash scripts/secret_taint_residual_smoke.sh
```

Close criteria for SPRINT T1:
1. T1-1, T1-2, T1-5 → REFUSE dual-path
2. T1-3 remains REFUSE
3. T1-3b (if-expr) → REFUSE if LBRACE fix lands
4. T1-4 either true alias refuse **or** residual-doc honest about scan accident
5. SECRET_TAINT / DESIGN / product binary **aligned** (no claim ahead of host)
6. Still **no** claim of full IFC

